{"title":"Sumo Tourists in London","link":"https://kottke.org/25/10/sumo-tourists-in-london","date":1760975514000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1734\" alt=\"group of sumo wrestlers in front of Big Ben\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"976\" alt=\"two sumo wrestlers posing at the British Museum\" /></p>\n\n<p>I’m totally charmed by these snaps of some of the best sumo wrestlers in the world touring London.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1145\" height=\"1445\" alt=\"group of sumo wrestlers riding bikes in London\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1734\" alt=\"a sumo wrestler posing in front of Big Ben\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"626\" alt=\"group of sumo wrestlers doing the Beatles Abbey Road walk\" /></p>\n\n<p>The athletes were in London for <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4gw7009342o\">a 5-day event at the Royal Albert Hall</a>.</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>London’s Victorian concert venue has been utterly transformed, complete with six-tonne Japanese temple roof suspended above the ring.</p>\n\n<p>It is here the wrestlers, known as rikishi, will perform their leg stomps to drive away evil spirits, and where they will clap to get the attention of the gods.</p>\n\n<p>And above all this ancient ceremony, a giant, revolving LED screen which wouldn’t look out of place at an American basketball game, offering the audience all the stats and replays they could want.</p>\n\n<p>Sumo may be ancient, and may have strict rules governing every aspect of a rikishi’s conduct, but it still exists in a modern world.</p>\n\n<p>And that modern world is helping spread sumo far beyond Japan’s borders.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1108\" height=\"1477\" alt=\"group of sumo wrestlers posing on Platform 9 3/4\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-07.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-07.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-07.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1734\" alt=\"two sumo wrestlers walking in London with Hello Kitty\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-08.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-08.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-08.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1497\" alt=\"two sumo wrestlers posing with Paddington Bear\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-09.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-09.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-09.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1388\" alt=\"a sumo wrestler trying to entice a squirrel\" /></p>\n\n<p>The tournament has already concluded; the winner, <a href=\"https://www.sumo.or.jp/EnSumoDataRikishi/profile/3842/\">Hoshoryu</a>, was given <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/sport/live/c62lp6835p1t?post=asset%3A940c579f-6924-46d5-89ca-c883f1c99aa0#post\">a giant bottle of soy sauce</a>:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-10.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-10.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sumo-london-10.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"814\" alt=\"a sumo wrestler holding a giant bottle of soy sauce\" /></p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/London\">London</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/sports\">sports</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/sumo\">sumo</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/10/sumo-tourists-in-london\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"302790d02b8d7777a87d4071314409c6faa75466c97bf0b180b7b659b7b9fba6","category":"Sites"}